{"sections":[{"slug":"广义上同调中的定向","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"广义上同调中的定向"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">广义上同调中的定向</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“广义上同调中的定向”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">向量丛的</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">定向</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">又叫</span> $E$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom类","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">是指与其</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom空间","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">作为球谱丛</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">相关联的</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">丛的平凡化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E∞-环","text":"E∞-<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>"}},{"Plain":" $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathrm {GL}_1(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\Omega^\\infty R$ <span lang=\"zh\">中对应</span> $\\pi_0(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆元的元素的子空间</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":". (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-向量丛","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":".) <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/J-同态","text":"J-<span lang=\"zh\">同态</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm O \\to\\mathrm {GL}_1(\\mathbb S)$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $V\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维向量丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">定向为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom空间","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm {Th}(V)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶约化</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">上同调的元素</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足限制在每个纤维上为</span> ($S^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶约化</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">上同调的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">生成元</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":", $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">可能带边</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>. $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">定向是</span> $E_n(X,\\partial X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的一个类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足对任意内部点</span> $x\\in X$, <span lang=\"zh\">它限制到</span> $E_n(X,X-\\{x\\})\\simeq E_n(D^n,S^{n-1})\\simeq E_0(*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的生成元</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆对于映射</span> $f\\colon B\\to\\mathrm {BGL}(n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span> $(B,f)$-<span lang=\"zh\">结构是其切丛的分类映射的提升</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\t&amp;&amp; B \\\\\r\n\t&amp; \\nearrow &amp; \\downarrow f\\hspace{-1em} \\\\\r\n\tX &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathrm {BGL}(n).\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}